# Case of the Gorgon's Kiss: "To solve - Three or more creature cards were put into graveyards from anywhere this turn" (CR 719.3a): only this turn's count. Bot1 discards a Memnite to Faithless Looting on turn 1; on turn 3
# it Bolts Bot2's Memnite and Ornithopter, so two creature cards were put into graveyards this turn and a third on an earlier one: the Case is not solved at the end step and stays a noncreature enchantment (it is not a
# 4/4 Gorgon, has no keywords). The scenario with the third card on the same turn is the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Case of the Gorgon's Kiss
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Memnite
Island
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Mountain x20

